# Scope

## Build (backend / WhatsApp / APIs)

Identity-aware routing for five personas. Low-friction triage (MSK + non-MSK). Deterministic red flags. Specialty matching. Paystack booking via webhooks. Physio WhatsApp onboarding, availability, alerts, session notes, payouts, home-visit check-in. Family add/revoke/permissions + physio relay. Partner referral tracking + ₦2,000 first-session fee. Admin escalation, verification quick-reply, broadcasts, stats digest. Append-only audit. Documented APIs for a separate frontend team.

## Do not build (stop and flag — change request)

- Physiotherapist profile & credentials **web dashboard**
- Admin Retool **UI**
- Partner **web portal**
- Patient/family **web receipt pages**
- Conversation-takeover **UI**
- HMO pre-authorisation export (format unconfirmed)
- Layer 3 (Exercise Prescription & Tracking)
- Voice-to-Text / Computer Vision add-ons beyond Gemini Live voice notes already in scope

Web is someone else's job. This repo still **owes** clean endpoints and data those UIs will consume.

## Defaults until Vance says otherwise

- Family access: **direct phone registration** (not redeemable codes).
- Physio availability: **free-text parse**, but isolate calendar writes so a slot picker can replace the parser later.
- Admin takeover: **visible** to the patient by default.
